        "Description": "LFC #24\r\rThe &quot;DEFENCEFORCE OF RIGHTFULL NATIONS&quot; also known as &quot;DORN&quot;, issued a contract for four members of a secret hunter organization specialized in hunting reptiles and selling their heads on the black market.\r\rThe Contractor emphasized on an approach of terminating them while wearing DON&apos;s traditional membership clothing to send a signal to the world, if you&apos;ll ever get spotted.\r\rGood luck agent.\r\rThis contract was created by a member of the HITMAN community known as GINkasu.",
